---
layout: default
description: Full-stack product architect. Two decades shipping Rails applications, products, and brands.
page_class: homepage
---

{% featured = collections.projects.resources.select { |project| project.data.group == "featured" }.sort_by { |project| project.data.order }.first(6) %}
{% project_count = collections.projects.resources.size %}

<div class="mx-auto w-[min(1080px,calc(100%-3rem))]">
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <h1 class="max-w-[11ch] text-[clamp(3.6rem,10vw,6rem)] font-black leading-[.88] tracking-[-.04em]">Now, not<br> <strong class="text-fire">later.</strong></h1>
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-[48ch] text-xl leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-2xl">The kind of builder who can take a knotty product from first sketch to live system and keep the shape all the way through.</p>
    <div class="mt-10 flex gap-10">
      <p><strong class="block text-4xl font-black text-fire">20+</strong><span class="text-base text-muted">years shipping</span></p>
      <p><strong class="block text-4xl font-black text-fire">{{ project_count }}</strong><span class="text-base text-muted">projects archived</span></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pt-6 pb-14 md:pt-12 md:pb-24">
    <div class="mb-8 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-.03em] md:text-6xl">Recent & defining work</h2>
      <a href="/projects/" class="font-semibold text-ink hover:text-fire-ink">All projects →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="gap-6 md:columns-2 lg:columns-3">
      {% featured.each do |project| %}
        <a href="{{ project.relative_url }}" class="project-card group mb-4 block break-inside-avoid">
          <figure class="project-media {{ !project.data.cover && !project.data.coverVideo && 'project-logo aspect-[16/10]' }} overflow-hidden bg-white">
            {%@ "project_media", project: project %}
          </figure>
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-5 py-5">
            <span>
              <strong class="block text-xl font-bold tracking-[-.02em] md:text-2xl">{{ project.data.name }}</strong>
              <span class="text-base mt-1 block text-muted">{{ project.data.summary }}</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% end %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid gap-10 py-16 md:grid-cols-2 md:py-24">
    <h2 class="max-w-[11ch] text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-.03em] md:text-6xl">Architecture. Product. Design.</h2>
    <div>
      <p class="mb-6 max-w-[55ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">Pharmacy ERP for 1,300+ stores. School platforms. Media products. Real Estate. Tangled systems turned into something clear, usable, and alive.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="mailto:nick@firedev.com" class="border border-ink bg-ink px-4 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white hover:border-fire hover:bg-fire hover:text-ink">Email ↗</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/firedev" class="border border-ink px-4 py-3 text-base font-semibold hover:border-fire hover:bg-fire hover:text-ink">GitHub ↗</a>
        <a href="https://git-wrapped.com/profiles/firedev" class="border border-ink px-4 py-3 text-base font-semibold hover:border-fire hover:bg-fire hover:text-ink">See how I work ↗</a>
        <a href="/about/" class="border border-ink px-4 py-3 text-base font-semibold hover:border-fire hover:bg-fire hover:text-ink">About →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
